# Traditional Gypsy Seer (Russian)

## Lore

The Gypsy Seer, also called the Gypsy Sorcerer, is a master psionic who also
casts - seven psychic powers from the start, four spells, and a life spent
accumulating more of both. He senses supernatural evil, reads palms, and records
his dreams.

He is also almost certainly illiterate. Only one Gypsy Seer in ten can read any
language at all, which does not stop him speaking four.

## Alignment

Any.

## GM Notes

His progression is the most elaborate in the book: for six consecutive levels he
is handed a specific named spell *and* a free pick, and only from eighth level
does it settle into two free picks a level.

The named spells tell you what the class is for - Oracle, Exorcism, Commune with
Spirits, Calling, both Protection Circles, Dispel Magic Barriers and Sanctum. He
is built to deal with things that should not be there.
', 'published', 'data-script'
